  skos:prefLabel "Decision Making" ;
  mi:categoryDescription "Sample Economics Compelling and Supporting Question HS Do taxes help 1) In what ways does the government of the United States collect taxes, and how ECONOMICS or hurt U.S. Individually and collaboratively, students will engage in planned inquiries to describe and demonstrate how the economic forces of scarcity and opportunity costs impact individual and household choices." ;
  mi:inCourse mi:Course_ECON ;
  mi:inDiscipline mi:Discipline_E ;
  mi:hasExample
    mi:Example_cat_ECON_4_1_1 ,
    mi:Example_cat_ECON_4_1_2 ,
